      <MissionDesc>Harmonium is a nonprofit 501c3 organization that reaches more than 30,000 San Diegans annually. Our collaborative, innovative programs provide quality integrated services that are culturally appropriate, trauma informed and customized to meet the needs of children, youth and their families in communities throughout San Diego.</MissionDesc>
