      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part III, Line 4d</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Program Service Expenses 19,376, Grants and allocations 0, Revenue 0 Youth Program provides case management and resources to children and youth ages 0-25 and their families that may have challenges at home, school in their community and are at-risk for justice involvement. Services are provided in Southeastern San Diego.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part III, Line 4d</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Program Service Expenses 455,122, Grants and allocations 0, Revenue 0 Community Education and Advocacy Program is the Resident Leadership/Homestart program which seeks to development of leadership skills and tools. to resolve RLA identified community issues that negatively impact resident health, safety and well-being. Help the community develop a Community action plan to engage local government, regional community residents and other solutions.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section B, Line 12c</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>The first item on the agenda for each Board meeting is the conflict of interest check-in. Each Board member signs a statement annually affirming they have read and understand the conflict of interest policy and that they agree to comply.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section B, Line 15a</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>The salary of the CEO is determined by the Board of Directors. The data used to determine the amount of compensation includes surveys of like organizations and published salary guideline data. All Harmonium Board and Board Committee meetings are documented with minutes.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section B, Line 15b</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Key employee salaries are reviewed by comparing the published salary guideline data and salaries of like organizations. Salaries are included in the annual budget, reviewed, by the Board of Directors Fiscal Committee and are approved by the Board of Directors.</ExplanationTxt>
